      "value": "@{5b7efd0f2929584072ccb6ff|full_name}: Yeah I hope the safety settings change that was made to be able to \"mosaic\" out the icon depending on people's trust ranking isn't the \"solution\" that they're also using for this issue.\nThe safety setting change is good, but there really should also just be an option in the nameplate settings to be able to hide/unhide icons.\nFor me it's not really a matter of safety, I just want the option to be able to turn icons on/off whenever I want, just like I can with nametags.",
      "viewerReactions": null
