  "details": "The new nameplates are awesome, and all the options they come with to make them bigger/smaller/transparent/etc.\nBut there seems to be one option that's missing. There's an option to have both nameplates and icons above someone's head, an option for only the icon above someone's head, yet no option for nametags only.\nAside from people not wanting to see icons, it could also be an issue for streamers if someone is using a NSFW icon on stream and they have no way of disabling it.",
